# eResto Digital Menu - MVVM Federated Package Plan

This document outlines the architecture, layer separation, and step-by-step plan for building and integrating the **eResto Digital Menu** as a federated package (`packages/digital_menu`) inside `eresto_edge_flutter`.

We will implement a clean **MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel)** architectural pattern. This ensures complete separation of business logic (Model/ViewModel) and UI logic (View), matching the expectations of an enterprise-level codebase.

---

## 1. Enterprise Architecture: MVVM + Federated Package

