## 4. Layer Implementation Details

### MVVM Flow Example (Menu Items Feature)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant View as MenuItemsPage (View)
    participant VM as MenuItemsViewModel (ViewModel)
    participant Repo as ItemsRepository (Model)
    participant Remote as ItemsRemoteDataSource
    participant Local as ItemsLocalDataSource (Isar Cache)

    View->>VM: onInit()
    activate VM
    VM->>VM: change(status: RxStatus.loading())
    VM->>Repo: getItems()
    activate Repo
    Repo->>Local: getCachedItems()
    Repo-->>VM: return cached items (optimistic fast render)
    VM-->>View: update Obx (cached UI)
    
    Repo->>Remote: fetchItems()
    activate Remote
    Remote-->>Repo: return fresh items from Laravel REST API
    deactivate Remote
    Repo->>Local: saveItemsToCache(freshItems)
    Repo-->>VM: return fresh items (Dartz Right)
    deactivate Repo
    VM->>VM: change(freshItems, status: RxStatus.success())
    VM-->>View: update Obx (fresh UI)
    deactivate VM
```

